  "contentHtml": "<p>다른 선생님도 올려주셨던 자료인 것 같은데, 설명서가 영어라 제 나름대로 한글로 번역해 둔 자료 공유합니다~</p><p>&#160;</p><p>3인 1조 기준 눈은 만드는 데 45분 빠듯하게 걸렸어요!</p><p>&#160;</p><p>감각 기관 단원은 강의식 수업에서 빠져나오기가 어려워서 이런 모형이라도 만들어보게 되네요ㅎㅎ</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0faaf6fdbed87260721f5fe1ad69804a44e24037?download\" data-file-name=\"DIY 종이 눈 모형.pdf\" data-file-size=\"213299\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D499%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20220520162306&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F0faaf6fdbed87260721f5fe1ad69804a44e24037')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">DIY 종이 눈 모형</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">208.30KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fbee32618a5e1226f2b48f499f3cc540dd08dc05?download\" data-file-name=\"Paper-eye-model-1.pdf\" data-file-size=\"4967716\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D499%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20220520162306&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Ffbee32618a5e1226f2b48f499f3cc540dd08dc05')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">Paper-eye-model-1</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">4.74MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a938fe6749184b07a1cf1979f40bc472d18539e1?download\" data-file-name=\"눈 모형 배경지_한글버전.pdf\" data-file-size=\"156313\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D499%26fileid%3D2%26